      "source_text": "只要真挚地面对她，她必会真挚地回应。\n在那漆黑的面纱背后，纯粹的光辉已逐渐崭露。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5aa5d4cbff32f96e1f3c2626ce94e69fbdcc8df407cf6b3973795d6fa90e67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
